WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:08.100
Open the Portfolio

2
00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:11.700
Tap + for a new project

3
00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:16.100
Ready-made plans for work people do again and again

4
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:20.000
Pick one — say, College Semester

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:23.600
Create

6
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.900
The project arrives with its tasks, headings and milestones

7
00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:32.000
Your own project can become one too

8
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.500
Open the Projects list

9
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.700
Touch and hold a project

10
00:00:39.700 --> 00:00:43.300
Save as Playbook

11
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:49.400
Its structure is kept; dates and progress are cleared

12
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:52.900
Start a new project again

13
00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:57.200
Scroll past the ready-made plans

14
00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:01.500
There it is, under Your Playbooks

15
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:11.000
…ready for the next project like it
